#: ../../source/get_started/quick_start.md:1
msgid "Quick Start"
msgstr "快速开始"

#: ../../source/get_started/quick_start.md:3
msgid ""
"This example runs a differential-drive robot from a start pose to a goal. "
"Before continuing, [install IR-SIM](install.rst) and verify that it imports "
"successfully."
msgstr ""
"本示例让一个差速驱动机器人从起始位姿运动到目标。在继续之前，请先[安装 IR-SIM]"
"(install.rst)，并确认可以成功导入。"

#: ../../source/get_started/quick_start.md:6
msgid "Create a Python file named `quick_start.py`:"
msgstr "创建名为 `quick_start.py` 的 Python 文件："

#: ../../source/get_started/quick_start.md:23
msgid "In the same directory, create `robot_world.yaml`:"
msgstr "在同一目录下创建 `robot_world.yaml`："

#: ../../source/get_started/quick_start.md:25
msgid ""
"The YAML file describes the world and robot. Change these values later to "
"customize the scene."
msgstr "该 YAML 文件描述世界和机器人。之后可修改这些值来自定义场景。"

#: ../../source/get_started/quick_start.md:47
msgid "Run the Python file from that directory:"
msgstr "在该目录中运行 Python 文件："

#: ../../source/get_started/quick_start.md:53
msgid ""
"Run the script and a window opens showing the differential-drive robot "
"navigating from its start to the goal:"
msgstr "运行脚本后会弹出一个窗口，显示差速驱动机器人从起点导航到目标："

#: ../../source/get_started/quick_start.md:55
msgid ""
"Quick-start simulation: a differential-drive robot navigating to its goal"
msgstr "快速开始仿真 —— 差速驱动机器人导航到目标"

#: ../../source/get_started/quick_start.md:66
msgid "Next steps"
msgstr "后续步骤"

#: ../../source/get_started/quick_start.md:68
msgid ""
"[Make Environment](../usage/make_environment.md): the simulation loop, "
"status control, and dynamic objects in depth."
msgstr ""
"[Make Environment](../usage/make_environment.md) —— 深入了解仿真循环、状态控"
"制和动态对象。"

#: ../../source/get_started/quick_start.md:69
msgid ""
"[Configure robots and obstacles](../usage/configure_robots_obstacles.md): "
"kinematics, shapes, and multi-object scenes."
msgstr ""
"[Configure robots and obstacles](../usage/configure_robots_obstacles.md) —— "
"运动学、形状和多对象场景。"

#: ../../source/get_started/quick_start.md:70
msgid ""
"[YAML Configuration](../yaml_config/configuration.md): the full "
"configuration reference with an interactive schema explorer."
msgstr ""
"[YAML Configuration](../yaml_config/configuration.md) —— 完整的配置参考，附带"
"交互式 schema 浏览器。"

#: ../../source/get_started/quick_start.md:61
msgid "The loop advances the simulation by `0.1` seconds per step, renders the latest state, and stops early when the environment reports that it is done. For a server or batch job, use `headless=True` to avoid creating a figure entirely; `env.render()` then becomes a no-op. Use `display=False` instead if you still need offscreen figures or animations."
msgstr "循环每步推进 `0.1` 秒仿真时间，渲染最新状态，并在环境报告完成时提前结束。服务器或批处理任务可使用 `headless=True`，完全避免创建图窗；此时 `env.render()` 不执行任何操作。如果仍需离屏图片或动画，请改用 `display=False`。"

#: ../../source/get_started/quick_start.md:67
msgid "Try one change at a time"
msgstr "每次尝试一个改动"

#: ../../source/get_started/quick_start.md:69
msgid "Change `goal` to `[9, 1, 0]`. The robot can now reach the goal along a straight line."
msgstr "将 `goal` 改为 `[9, 1, 0]`。机器人现在可以沿直线到达目标。"

#: ../../source/get_started/quick_start.md:70
msgid "Set `step_time` to `0.05` and increase the loop budget to `600`. Both budgets represent up to 30 simulated seconds; compare the paths, not just the frame counts."
msgstr "将 `step_time` 设为 `0.05`，并将循环上限增加到 `600`。两种设置都对应最多 30 秒仿真时间；请比较轨迹，而不仅是帧数。"

#: ../../source/get_started/quick_start.md:71
msgid "Explore the [kinematics lab](kinematics.md) to see how heading and velocity produce motion before adding obstacles or a controller."
msgstr "在加入障碍物或控制器之前，先用[运动学实验](kinematics.md) 了解航向与速度如何产生运动。"

#: ../../source/get_started/quick_start.md:73
msgid "The default `dash` behavior chooses commands toward the goal. It is not a path planner: adding an obstacle does not automatically make the robot plan around it. Continue with [behaviors](../usage/configure_behavior.md) or [path planning](../usage/configure_path_planning.md) for avoidance and planning."
msgstr "默认的 `dash` 行为生成朝向目标的指令，但它不是路径规划器：加入障碍物并不会自动让机器人规划绕行路径。请继续阅读[行为配置](../usage/configure_behavior.md) 或[路径规划](../usage/configure_path_planning.md)，了解避碰与规划。"
